  "details": "It seems some bug is causing Lighting to look drastically brighter in-game than as it is shown in-editor. This was not an issue in 2018.  I've heard it could have something to do with Dynamic GI. My world does have Dynamic GI, and it currently works, just the dark levels are completely too bright!\nIn The attached image, 2019 editor preview is on the left, In-game is the right.",
